<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH MINER MOSTECKA 9MONTH PROFIT DOWN.</title>
<headline>CZECH MINER MOSTECKA 9MONTH PROFIT DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for nine months ending September 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit		   420.509    vs	   638.717</p>
<p> Operating profit	     340.786    vs	   582.407</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services		 6,486.332    vs	 5,906.563</p>
<p> Total assets		14,689,927    vs	14,491.761</p>
<p> Basic capital		8,835.898    vs	 8,835.898</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the the northern Czech coal miner is Mostecka Uhelna a.s.. Results were provided by the company. Mostecka shares are traded on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
